{
    "title": "Sezzle - Buy Now, Pay Later",
    "description": "Sezzle, the ultimate buy now, pay later shopping app empowering you to buy what you love today and pay in easy, interest-free installments over six weeks.\u00b9 \r\n\r\nEffortlessly split your purchases into four payments while making shopping more accessible and managing your budget easier with shop now pay later options.\u00b9\r\n\r\nDiscover the smarter way to shop, earn rewards and stay ahead of your finances with Sezzle's pay in 4 solution \u2013 no impact to your credit score upon sign up, no interest, no hidden fees, and no catch!\u00b9\r\n\r\n\r\nSezzle: A Top Rated Buy Now, Pay Later App\r\n\r\n- BUY NOW PAY LATER\r\nInstantly access thousands of retailers you already love and enjoy the flexibility of paying over time.\r\n\r\n- PAY IN 4 EASY PAYMENTS\r\nShop in-app or in-store today and pay in four equal, interest-free installments over six weeks.\u00b9\r\n\r\n- NO INTEREST & NO HIDDEN FEES\r\nExperience transparent shopping with no surprises. Enjoy interest-free installments without hidden fees using one of the best installment payment apps as seen on Investopedia and LendingTree.\r\n\r\n- SHOP SMARTER\r\nManage your spending and stay on top of your finances with our intuitive app. Sezzle makes it easier to buy what you need, track your payments and budget your expenses with our installment payment services.\r\n\r\n- INSTANT APPROVAL DECISION\r\nNo long forms to fill out at signup.\u200b\u200b You\u2019ll know if you\u2019re approved instantly and can start shopping right away.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures Our Users Love:\r\n\r\n- SEAMLESS EXPERIENCE\r\nDiscover the simplicity of Sezzle installment payments at your favorite online stores - just select Sezzle at checkout. Also add Sezzle to Apple Wallet or Google Pay to pay in 4 anywhere Visa\u00ae is accepted.\r\n\r\n- FLEXIBLE RESCHEDULES\r\nLife happens, we get it. Easily reschedule payments if you need extra time without any hassles.\r\n\r\n- EXCLUSIVE DEALS & OFFERS\r\nGet access to special promotions, discounts, and exclusive offers, only provided to our users, from our top name retail partners.\r\n\r\n- SECURE & RESPONSIBLE SPENDING\r\nSezzle promotes financial responsibility in all facets of our product. Shop confidently knowing you\u2019re in control with our consumer financing options.\r\n\r\n- EASY SIGNUP\r\nA quick, simple sign-up process. Get started today and experience the convenience of Sezzle financing that makes it one of the best installment payment options.\r\n\r\nDownload Sezzle today and experience the freedom of buying now and paying later, with the flexibility of paying in 4 easy installments.\u00b9\r\n\r\n\r\nSezzle: The Responsible Way to Pay\r\n\r\n\u00b9Pay in 4 and Pay in 2 loans are originated by WebBank except loans in IA and Puerto Rico. For example, for a $300 loan, you would make one $75 down payment today, then three $75 payments every two weeks for a 35.40% annual percentage rate (APR) and a total of payments of $305.99 which includes a $5.99 Service Fee (finance charge) charged at loan origination. Service fees vary and can range from $0 to $5.99 depending on the purchase price and Sezzle product. Actual fees are reflected in checkout.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sezzle, the ultimate buy now, pay later shopping app empowering you to buy what you love today and pay in easy, interest-free installments over six weeks.\u00b9 <br><br>Effortlessly split your purchases into four payments while making shopping more accessible and managing your budget easier with shop now pay later options.\u00b9<br><br>Discover the smarter way to shop, earn rewards and stay ahead of your finances with Sezzle&#39;s pay in 4 solution \u2013 no impact to your credit score upon sign up, no interest, no hidden fees, and no catch!\u00b9<br><br><br>Sezzle: A Top Rated Buy Now, Pay Later App<br><br>- BUY NOW PAY LATER<br>Instantly access thousands of retailers you already love and enjoy the flexibility of paying over time.<br><br>- PAY IN 4 EASY PAYMENTS<br>Shop in-app or in-store today and pay in four equal, interest-free installments over six weeks.\u00b9<br><br>- NO INTEREST &amp; NO HIDDEN FEES<br>Experience transparent shopping with no surprises. Enjoy interest-free installments without hidden fees using one of the best installment payment apps as seen on Investopedia and LendingTree.<br><br>- SHOP SMARTER<br>Manage your spending and stay on top of your finances with our intuitive app. Sezzle makes it easier to buy what you need, track your payments and budget your expenses with our installment payment services.<br><br>- INSTANT APPROVAL DECISION<br>No long forms to fill out at signup.\u200b\u200b You\u2019ll know if you\u2019re approved instantly and can start shopping right away.<br><br><br>Features Our Users Love:<br><br>- SEAMLESS EXPERIENCE<br>Discover the simplicity of Sezzle installment payments at your favorite online stores - just select Sezzle at checkout. Also add Sezzle to Apple Wallet or Google Pay to pay in 4 anywhere Visa\u00ae is accepted.<br><br>- FLEXIBLE RESCHEDULES<br>Life happens, we get it. Easily reschedule payments if you need extra time without any hassles.<br><br>- EXCLUSIVE DEALS &amp; OFFERS<br>Get access to special promotions, discounts, and exclusive offers, only provided to our users, from our top name retail partners.<br><br>- SECURE &amp; RESPONSIBLE SPENDING<br>Sezzle promotes financial responsibility in all facets of our product. Shop confidently knowing you\u2019re in control with our consumer financing options.<br><br>- EASY SIGNUP<br>A quick, simple sign-up process. Get started today and experience the convenience of Sezzle financing that makes it one of the best installment payment options.<br><br>Download Sezzle today and experience the freedom of buying now and paying later, with the flexibility of paying in 4 easy installments.\u00b9<br><br><br>Sezzle: The Responsible Way to Pay<br><br>\u00b9Pay in 4 and Pay in 2 loans are originated by WebBank except loans in IA and Puerto Rico. For example, for a $300 loan, you would make one $75 down payment today, then three $75 payments every two weeks for a 35.40% annual percentage rate (APR) and a total of payments of $305.99 which includes a $5.99 Service Fee (finance charge) charged at loan origination. Service fees vary and can range from $0 to $5.99 depending on the purchase price and Sezzle product. Actual fees are reflected in checkout.",
